<title>UK: BPP sells 75 pct stake in Selmore Films.</title>
<headline>BPP sells 75 pct stake in Selmore Films.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BPP Holdings Plc, which is engaged in professional, academic and language training and publishing, said on Tuesday it had sold its 75 percent stake in Selmore Films Ltd to MediaKey Plc.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the trustees of Richard Roxburgh, who hold the remaining 25 percent were also selling their holding to MediaKey.</p>
<p>The purchase price for the entire holding is 5.15 million stg, mainly in cash.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
